  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">You gain access to uncommon weapons with the avekiri trait. You gain familiarity with avekiri weapons and the guisarme, trident, composite longbow and longbow -- For the purpose of determining your proficiency, you treat any of these that are martial weapons as simple weapons and advanced weapons as martial weapons.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">At 5th level, whenever you get a critical hit with one of these weapons, you get its critical specialization effect.</span></p>"
